Cell["\<\
A metric basis of a path, a cycle, a grid and the Petersen graph: one end, \
two neighbours, two corners of one side and three vertices.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"97a787c3-c450-4054-a90f-a55c6d0d8642"],

