Cell["\<\
Past the smallest size the sets need not be minimal. On a path the third set \
found, {4, 5}, contains the resolving set {5}.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"ceb61741-2a04-45ed-a718-d04bd6cd120a"],

